 None. Use Fluent\u002FSDK RequestOptions directly\nwhen your mutation workflow needs an explicit stable idempotency key.",[489,937,939],{"id":938},"reconcile-a-known-checkout","Reconcile a known checkout",[494,941,943],{"className":496,"code":942,"language":498,"meta":499,"style":499},"from vatly_django.billing import Billing\n\n\ndef example(billable):\n    result = Billing().reconcile(billable, \"checkout_example\")\n    # Schedule a bounded later reconcile while either tuple is not empty.\n    return result.unresolved_line_ids, result.pending_subscription_ids\n",[501,944,945,959,963,967,979,1010,1016],{"__ignoreMap":499},[504,946,947,949,951,953,955,957],{"class":506,"line":507},[504,948,511],{"class":510},[504,950,515],{"class":514},[504,952,519],{"class":518},[504,954,522],{"class":514},[504,956,525],{"class":510},[504,958,528],{"class":514},[504,960,961],{"class":506,"line":531},[504,962,535],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":534},[504,964,965],{"class":506,"line":538},[504,966,535],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":534},[504,968,969,971,973,975,977],{"class":506,"line":543},[504,970,547],{"class":546},[504,972,551],{"class":550},[504,974,554],{"class":518},[504,976,558],{"class":557},[504,978,561],{"class":518},[504,980,981,984,987,990,992,995,997,999,1001,1003,1006,1008],{"class":506,"line":564},[504,982,983],{"class":514},"    result ",[504,985,986],{"class":518},"=",[504,988,989],{"class":550}," Billing",[504,991,583],{"class":518},[504,993,994],{"class":550},"reconcile",[504,996,554],{"class":518},[504,998,558],{"class":550},[504,1000,593],{"class":518},[504,1002,596],{"class":518},[504,1004,1005],{"class":599},"checkout_example",[504,1007,603],{"class":518},[504,1009,639],{"class":518},[504,1011,1012],{"class":506,"line":577},[504,1013,1015],{"class":1014},"sHwdD","    # Schedule a bounded later reconcile while either tuple is not empty.\n",[504,1017,1018,1020,1023,1025,1029,1031,1033,1035],{"class":506,"line":642},[504,1019,567],{"class":510},[504,1021,1022],{"class":514}," result",[504,1024,519],{"class":518},[504,1026,1028],{"class":1027},"swJcz","unresolved_line_ids",[504,1030,593],{"class":518},[504,1032,1022],{"class":514},[504,1034,519],{"class":518},[504,1036,1037],{"class":1027},"pending_subscription_ids\n",[485,1039,1040],{},"The facade checks the checkout's host record, performs bounded API reads and\npersists snapshots\u002Flinks transactionally. This may hold the scope lock during\nreads; run it in a worker for busy deployments. It emits no created outbox event.",[485,1042,1043,1044,1047],{},"Signup lines reference their plan and name their subscription in\n",[501,1045,1046],{},"relatedResources.subscriptionId","; renewal lines reference the subscription as\ntheir product. Both link the subscription to the checkout's billable.",[647,1049,1050,1062],{},[650,1051,1052],{},[653,1053,1054,1057,1059],{},[656,1055,1056],{},"Result field",[656,1058,661],{},[656,1060,1061],{},"What to do",[663,1063,1064,1077,1090,1106],{},[653,1065,1066,1071,1074],{},[668,1067,1068],{},[501,1069,1070],{},"subscriptions",[668,1072,1073],{},"Linked and stored subscriptions",[668,1075,1076],{},"Nothing",[653,1078,1079,1084,1087],{},[668,1080,1081],{},[501,1082,1083],{},"pending_subscription_ids",[668,1085,1086],{},"Referenced, but not readable yet",[668,1088,1089],{},"Reconcile again later",[653,1091,1092,1096,1103],{},[668,1093,1094],{},[501,1095,1028],{},[668,1097,1098,1099,1102],{},"Signup lines whose ",[501,1100,1101],{},"subscriptionId"," is still null",[668,1104,1105],{},"Reconcile again later; it may never resolve",[653,1107,1108,1113,1119],{},[668,1109,1110],{},[501,1111,1112],{},"legacy_plan_ids",[668,1114,1115,1116],{},"Plan lines on historical orders without ",[501,1117,1118],{},"relatedResources",[668,1120,1121],{},"Resolve manually",[485,1123,1124,1125,1128,1129,1131,1132,1134],{},"A signed ",[501,1126,1127],{},"order.paid"," snapshot is frozen when it is sent and can carry a null\n",[501,1130,1101],{},", so the first order may still need an explicit reconcile. Schedule\na bounded number of later reconciles while ",[501,1133,1028],{}," is not empty.\nNever guess by customer\u002Fplan\u002Fquantity. Missing subscription IDs remain pending,\nnot entitled. Trial flows may lack an order.paid event.",[485,1136,1137,1138,1141,1142,1149],{},"Grace expiry uses Fluent's shared mapper. ",[501,1139,1140],{},"canceledAt"," is the request time.\nMissing or ambiguous period deadlines raise and retain the prior committed state;\nmonitor and reconcile instead of inventing an expiry. Active snapshots clear stale\nends after resume. ",[1143,1144,1148],"a",{"href":1145,"rel":1146},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fpackages\u002Ffluent-python\u002Fsubscriptions",[1147],"nofollow","Fluent's guide","\ndescribes this policy and its limits.",[485,1151,1152],{},[1143,1153,1156],{"href":1154,"rel":1155},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Fsubscriptions",[1147],"Subscription API reference",[1158,1159,1160],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .sHdIc, html code.shiki .sHdIc{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#BABED8;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6